+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured end to end with `muninn-bench perf` on a synthetic store containing
+5,000 records and 15,000 cues, using 300 hook invocations on the same machine:
+
+| Version | SessionStart p50 |
+|---|---:|
+| Before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path | 16.732 ms |
+| After `quick_check` was moved off the read path | 0.971 ms |
+
+The after version is the change that also introduced the trigger-maintained
+`fts_rows` counter and the body `CHECK` constraint. The figures above are measured
+hook wall-clock times, including process startup; they are not estimates.
